        "created_at": "2019-01-19T20:09:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Any interest in an organized \"slate\" of programming a la a couple years back? In particular, I'm kind of thinking a SI Tournament in the Friday night slot (and, if GtG will let us, sneak previewing something else from JE by surprise).</p>\n<p>Regardless, I'll be present. I currently think my son will be with my for a day of D&amp;D on Saturday, including participating in the Epic, but that would leave me Friday and Sunday to help out with stuff.</p>",
