        "cooked": "<p>I believe Maggie is working on it. I'm sure we'll hear something soon. :-D&nbsp;</p>\n<p>In any case, I'll be doing the annual Sentinel Tactics game to intro tweens and teens to miniature gaming along with other things (e.g., pop-up SotM and Spirit Island demos).&nbsp;</p>",
