        "id": 225068,
        "name": "Twitsan",
        "username": "Twitsan",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/9f8e36/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-01-20T01:20:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Form the conversation I had with most of the GTG staff I believe they are going to still be in recovery mode from PAX East the previous weekend.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>That being said they all have a standing invite to come as themselves and not as a GTG employee.</p>\n<p>I like Rabit will be running pop up events throughout the weekend. We have a mostly complete copy (as in all the expansions) of SOTM, Fate of the Elder Gods, Spirit Island, the RPG starter kit, as well as a smattering of their smaller games available in the WYG library.</p>",
