        "created_at": "2019-01-20T02:27:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>GtG has never really had an official presence at WYC aside from those of us who have run stuff on their behalf. &nbsp;Seems like maybe my pinging Maggie about the OK to have an SI tournament might not be a bad idea.</p>\n<p>Russ, if you have time for an SI game, either with Andy &amp; the rest of the Indy playtest group or that might finally give me a chance to meet Mrs. Rabit (since I hear about her every year), I'd love to make it work. Be good for me to get outside the hivemind of my current group.</p>",
