        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"dyeung87\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/e99b99/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> dyeung87:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Speaking of Pax East, any word if they need volunteers for that event? I did it last year&nbsp;and it was a blast!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Per the latest Citizen&nbsp;Insider:</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Maggie\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/maggie/48/1924_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Maggie:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>With those changes in mind, we are looking for Citizens for&nbsp;<a href=\"https://sentinelsofthemultiverse.us2.list-manage.com/track/click?u=54df0deae6c0b2c4030c777e6&amp;id=7029cf8758&amp;e=f98c7f054e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">PAX East</a>&nbsp;(March 28-31) and we would love to work with you or anyone you might want to recommend!&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:citizens@greaterthangames.com?subject=PAX%20East\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Please email me for more details</a><a href=\"mailto:citizens@greaterthangames.com?subject=PAX%20East\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">!</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>",
